        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/rabit/{size}/7330_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-11-30T02:57:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>It really was entertaining to see AA tossing around so much damage.  <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slightly_smiling_face.png?v=12\" title=\":slightly_smiling_face:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slightly_smiling_face:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>\n<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"phantaskippy\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantaskippy/48/1897_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> phantaskippy:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Are they posted on BGG? &nbsp;I have used several from there.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>They aren't - I don't really post on BGG much. I actually created these purely as something to fill time while I was between running tabletop RPGs, not really as something to share, but I suppose it would be good to get some feedback and ideas for improvements…</p>\n<p>I'll see about posting them on BGG. Might be a bit - sick right now and busy weekend coming.</p>",
