        "raw": "Okay, <a href=\"http://boardgamegeek.com/article/14130471#14130471\">I shared</a>. Please post any feedback <a href=\"http://boardgamegeek.com/thread/1079439/custom-villain-and-environment-lucas-halkom-kad\">there</a>, though. (Or just enjoy playing with the decks!)\n\n[quote=\"Ronway\"]\n\nThat&#39;s when you know you don&#39;t play with me enough. I tend to make it a side goal to get set up for damage.\n\n[/quote]\n\nIt just so rarely happens so impressively. It&#39;s kinda like the game in which I drew 7 of Visionary&#39;s damage-dealing cards. She was a powerhouse of brutality that game and did virtually nothing else (except her base power)! I&#39;ve only seen that happen one other time (I&#39;m sure it does) and it&#39;s very humorous to see it.\n\nNow, having side goals is always fun - that one just seems like a good challenge. (My spouse always has a side goal for NightMist to end at maximum hit points, but that&#39;s not quite as difficult.  :wink: )",
